{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1321520001:0":{"text":"Hey, you must be tourists visiting Cedartown! Interested in checking out my amulets? They're family heirlooms, and I'm in a bit of a bind for money, so I'm selling a few.","source_cn":"哎呀，你们是来雪松镇旅游的游客吧？需不需要护身符？这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87BC40FF4BC556D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321520002:0":{"text":"Wow... so many! Your family really has quite the collection of amulets.","source_cn":"哇……这么多！看起来你找——呃，你家家传了不少护身符呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x051D651ADE7CE633","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321520003:0":{"text":"Oh well, my ancestors used to make these. That's why there are so many left.","source_cn":"唉，听说俺家祖上有人是做这个的，这才留了不少下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC5EFEF2E60E4F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321520004:0":{"text":"Hold on, you with the glasses... I know you!","source_cn":"那位戴眼镜的小哥，你——哎，俺怎么看你这么眼熟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66A2156E9AB50AB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321520005:0":{"text":"Uh... You sold me a bracelet last time.","source_cn":"哦……是、是眼熟……之前你在雪松镇上的时候，卖给过我一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA01D59D95CF43E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321520006:0":{"text":"Oh, that's right! You were with a girl, right? Where is she now?","source_cn":"噢，俺想起来了，那天你和另一个小姑娘在一起。哎，怎么不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97F3DBB1E0055D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321520007:0":{"text":"Uh... Melissa... she... well... hmmm... ACHOO!","source_cn":"呃……梅丽莎她……这个……阿嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0941855491B943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1321520007":{"text":"Uh... Melissa... she... well... hmmm... ACHOO!","source_cn":"呃……梅丽莎她……这个……阿嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0941855491B943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321520008:0":{"text":"She said she found an ancient tomb in the Petalia Plains and wants us to come over and help check if it's real.","source_cn":"没错……！她说她在繁花原野发现了一个古代墓穴，让我们过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD57BD48EF01E15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321520010:0":{"text":"T-that's right! It's all thanks to that bracelet you sold us.","source_cn":"啊……对！这、这还是多亏了你卖给我们的那个手环。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C744ADE7E992A34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321520011:1":{"text":"What does it have to do with the bracelet...?","source_cn":"……这和手环有啥关系？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFE17225D6D154E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321520012:0":{"text":"W-well you told us that the bracelet was found in the Petalia Plains, so uh... she went and found more artifacts... ACHOO!","source_cn":"因为……因为你说手环是在繁花原野上捡到的，她觉得这附近...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EDCE372E250742F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321520013:0":{"text":"Oh, wow! Lucky her!","source_cn":"噢，噢！那可真走运咧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A9C57C247BD136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321520014:0":{"text":"It's not easy to track someone down in a place overflowing with flowers. Are you sure you know where she is? Maybe I can... assist with finding her.","source_cn":"你们知道她在什么位置不？俺可以给你指路！这原野上到处都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61B2BA484196B6BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321520015:0":{"text":"Don't worry! We know where she is! Ouch! Hammie, why did you hit me?","source_cn":"没关系，我们找得到——呜！漫漫，你打我干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6512D77EB7D93B0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321520016:0":{"text":"Ahem, I think Melissa said she's <style=\"highlight\">south of the Ruins Bridge</style>. It shouldn't be too hard to find her, right?","source_cn":"那个……梅丽莎说是在<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC36215BDF766FDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321520017:0":{"text":"Oh, then just head toward the Ruins Bridge—you can't miss it!","source_cn":"噢，那你们朝着遗迹大桥的方向走就行，不可能迷路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77497A888D18F311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321520018:0":{"text":"Great! Thank you, Sir!","source_cn":"那真是太好了，谢谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17944A43D3CFEB2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321520019:0":{"text":"Anytime! I've got things to take care of, so I'll head home now. Bye!","source_cn":"嘿，不用客气！正好俺也有事，就先回家了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E7E66B09A4D5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"We're actually about to go find her.","source_cn":"我们正要去找她","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A3FF63E28275619","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're actually about to go find her.","female":"We're actually about to go find her.","variant_male_record_index":"69404","variant_female_record_index":"69405","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1321520009:0":{"text":"What?! An ancient tomb?!","source_cn":"……啥？！还有古代墓穴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ACB50E4DAA57581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"She discovered an ancient tomb.","source_cn":"她发现了一个古代墓穴","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0A03E0174D1794F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"She discovered an ancient tomb.","female":"She discovered an ancient tomb.","variant_male_record_index":"69406","variant_female_record_index":"69407","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卖手环的镇民":{"text":"Merchant","source":"卖手环的镇民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伽利":{"text":"Gali","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count"